Thistle Monroe, styled Second-Among-Equals, is the person the [[Org/The Harlequins/index|Harlequins]] named, through the prism game at the [[Geography/Færrin/Calaria/Ragged Roost|Ragged Roost]] pilgrimage, as most likely to knowingly lead the Party to [[Phenomena/Keystone|keystone]] 15. Nothing else is known of them.
